  "stem": "A gramophone record is revolving with an angular velocity ω. A coin is placed at a distance r from the centre of the record. The static coefficient of friction is µ. The coin will revolve with the record if:",
  "options": {
    "A": "$r \\geq \\frac{\\mu g}{\\omega^{2}}$",
    "B": "$r = \\mu g\\omega^{2}$",
    "C": "$r < \\frac{\\omega^{2}}{\\mu g}$",
    "D": "$r \\leq \\frac{\\mu g}{\\omega^{2}}$"
  },
  "answer": {
